-V1 副本](https://vq8ovppcbo4.feishu.cn/wiki/ANmewoOBiikiXSk92hjcbzuynrg?from=from_copylink)\n\n专注解决生成图像多视角，不会用提示词描述的问题。\n\n## 核心功能\n\n1. 内置 96 组相机姿势预设；\n    \n2. 可视化角度调节；\n    \n3. 预设6组角度；\n    \n\n## 使用方法\n\n1、上传图像；\n\n2、调整视角；\n\n3、运行；\n\n## 模型下载\n\n工作流所需模型、Lora：https://pan.quark.cn/s/ce96c5a17fc5\n\n## 个人简介\n\n作者：桔子，专注于ComfyUI商业应用\n\nComfyUI 工作流专业开发者｜定制专属工作流 / 系统课程 / 一对一指导\n\n加微【xyxy444888】备注问题，领《ComfyUI报错解决手册》"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [406.80450439453125, 502.173583984375], "pos": [-4147.16259765625, -3156.48095703125], "id": 170, "properties": {}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "workspace_info": {"id": "KA6Ai3kJYLUAtauXc7TRY"}, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.28.6", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {}, "ds": {"offset": [4681.428167670437, 3610.785688606922], "scale": 0.8769226950000034}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 11, "title": "加载模型", "bounding": [-3080, 140, 500, 800]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 12, "title": "提示词+采样", "bounding": [-3100, -700, 1730, 770]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 13, "title": "角度1", "bounding": [-3270, -3200, 400, 600]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 14, "title": "角度2", "bounding": [-2850, -3200, 400, 600]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 15, "title": "角度3", "bounding": [-2410, -3200, 400, 600]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 16, "title": "角度4", "bounding": [-3270, -2570, 400, 600]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 17, "title": "角度5", "bounding": [-2850, -2570, 400, 600]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 18, "title": "角度6", "bounding": [-2410, -2570, 400, 600]}, {"color": "